      </FB>
      <FB Name="Module" Type="modlib::MOD_StateManager" x="3890" y="150" Comment="The module's PackML state. The owner calls Reset, Start, Stop, Abort or Clear at /Objects/Filling2/Module; State is at /Objects/Filling2/Module/State and on loc[Filling2/state]. Reset runs the Resetting procedure, Stop the Stopping procedure; skills may be started only in Execute.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaEnable" Value="TRUE" />
        <Parameter Name="StopTimeout" Value="T#10000ms" />
        <Attribute Name="GroupName" Type="STRING" Value="ModuleLevel" />
      </FB>
      <FB Name="LinearAxis" Type="filling::EQ_LinearAxis" x="1700" y="150" Comment="Equipment LinearAxis: Needle lift, a stepper motor through a step and direction driver, with a limit switch at the top (home). The only block that touches its pins (AtHome = modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:10:d0:], Enable = modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::c0], Down = modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::c1], Step = modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::h0]). Skills send it what to switch on loc[Filling2/LinearAxis/cmd]; it reports its inputs on loc[Filling2/LinearAxis/state] and at /Objects/Filling2/Equipment/LinearAxis.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaEnable" Value="TRUE" />
        <Parameter Name="AtHome_Address" Value="'modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:10:d0:]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Enable_Address" Value="'modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::c0]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Down_Address" Value="'modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::c1]'" />
        <Parameter Name="Step_Address" Value="'modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:0::h0]'" />
        <Attribute Name="GroupName" Type="STRING" Value="EquipmentIO" />
      </FB>
      <FB Name="Pump" Type="filling::EQ_Pump" x="4320" y="150" Comment="Equipment Pump: Filling pump; none is wired yet, so it has no outputs and dispensing is a time at the station's flow rate. The only block that touches its pins (no pins). Skills send it what to switch on loc[Filling2/Pump/cmd]; it reports its inputs on loc[Filling2/Pump/state] and at /Objects/Filling2/Equipment/Pump.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaEnable" Value="TRUE" />
        <Attribute Name="GroupName" Type="STRING" Value="EquipmentIO" />
      </FB>
      <FB Name="Scale" Type="filling::EQ_Scale" x="7300" y="150" Comment="Equipment Scale: Scale; the hardware has none, so the weight is simulated. The only block that touches its pins (Weight = modbus[127.0.0.1:1508:1:10:i0:]). Skills send it what to switch on loc[Filling2/Scale/cmd]; it reports its inputs on loc[Filling2/Scale/state] and at /Objects/Filling2/Equipment/Scale.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Filling2&quot;" />
        <Parameter Name="UaRoot" Value="&quot;/Objects/Filling2&quot;" />
