      </FB>
      <FB Name="Home" Type="filling::SK_Home" x="1155" y="150" Comment="Skill Home, offered on its own: Needle up to the limit switch; from there its position is known, using LinearAxis. A client calls Start (with the parameters), Stop, Abort or Reset at /Objects/Filling2/Skills/Home; State, ErrorID, Parameters and Results are there too.">
