      <FB Name="MoveAxis" Type="filling::SK_MoveAxis" x="3935" y="150" Comment="Skill MoveAxis, offered on its own: Needle to Position, measured down from the limit switch; the direction follows from where it is, using LinearAxis. A client calls Start (with the parameters), Stop, Abort or Reset at /Objects/Filling2/Skills/MoveAxis; State, ErrorID, Parameters and Results are there too.">
