      <FB Name="Dispense" Type="filling::SK_Dispense" x="6800" y="150" Comment="Skill Dispense, offered on its own: Dispense a volume at the station's flow rate (open loop, by time, until a pump is wired), using Pump. A client calls Start (with the parameters), Stop, Abort or Reset at /Objects/Filling2/Skills/Dispense; State, ErrorID, Parameters and Results are there too.">
        <Parameter Name="Module" Value="&quot;Filling2&quot;" />
