          <Group Name="Core" Comment="The skill's state machine: Stop, Abort, Reset, State and ErrorID over OPC UA; gives up everything the skill holds when a run ends" x="1000" y="1000" width="3750" height="3090" locked="false" />
          <Group Name="Start" Comment="The Start method: one block per parameter (range check, value for this run), the values published" x="1000" y="4390" width="8955" height="1880" locked="false" />
